  <item>
    <title>42.不再延迟满足，日日是好日 | 12个治愈时刻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b8182b606e5c5940e48ae8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b8182b606e5c5940e48ae8</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Feb 2025 06:20:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们新年好！蛇年第一期来啦，一起来感受我们的治愈时刻吧，让你舒服的生活方式就是最好的生活！</span></p><span></span><p><span>---欢迎使用时间轴跳转你感兴趣的部分---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> 时刻1：每周六的“循环日程”：放下手机，好好关照自己的两个小时。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a> 时刻2：和小猫互动并收获一些猫猫哲学。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 时刻3：节日里的“实用主义仪式感”，在《老友记》里过圣诞。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 时刻4：学做新菜，哪怕会炸厨房。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 时刻5：抽盲盒，拜托拜托不是最差的就好。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a> 时刻6：学跳街舞，想要更大胆和自由。(收到小羊的视频之后才知道她在这一段说得有多谦虚)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2399">39:59</a> 时刻7：两个人的KTV，只为享受唱歌本身不是为了“更好”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">47:09</a> 时刻8：对每个人都平等的漂亮夕阳和月升月落。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3229">53:49</a> 时刻9：当收到/释放陌生人的善意时。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3547">59:07</a> 时刻10：从玄学中寻找治愈，用虚无打败现实的焦虑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4179">01:09:39</a> 时刻11：剪短头发，换新发型。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4315">01:11:55</a> 时刻12：半夜去海底捞，安全稳定的温暖。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b26ace88217fcd99e638ea/liCeSeLu3DyogQAdCI1HTl5nIBYK.m4a" length="72845159" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnI8y9OxdBFoPj9tGDnrNICR8RLj.png"/>
